<Layout title="Food & Drink" description="Restaurants, bars, breweries, and groceries near the farm.">
	<p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/activities">Activities</a> › Food &amp; Drink</p>

	<div class="page-header">
		<h1>Food &amp; Drink</h1>
	</div>

	<div class="prose">
		<h2>Cafés &amp; Restaurants</h2>
		<p><strong>Sunne &amp; Västra Ämtervik (5–15 min drive)</strong></p>
		<ul class="entry-list">
			<li><a href="https://kulinarika.se/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kulinarika</a><span class="entry-meta">10 min</span><p>Hands-down the best restaurant in Sunne — the chef has worked at 2-star Michelin restaurants and is a certified sommelier. Check their hours; they may cater special events too.</p></li>
			<li><a href="https://saffranvitlok.se/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Saffran &amp; Vitlök</a><span class="entry-meta">10 min</span><p>Classic Swedish home cooking, great for lunch — and the town's best cappuccinos.</p></li>
			<li><a href="https://sillegarden.se/ata/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sillegården</a><span class="entry-meta">15 min · summer only</span><p>A cute restaurant in a beautiful spot — check if they're playing a concert while you're here.</p></li>
			<li><a href="https://selmaspa.se/restaurang-och-barer-just-nu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Selma Spa Hotel</a><span class="entry-meta">5 min</span><p>A formal hotel restaurant with appetizers, fresh fish, and a proper wine list.</p></li>
			<li><a href="https://www.tigrisrestaurangsunne.se/Vedugns-pizzeria.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vedugns Pizzeria</a><span class="entry-meta">10 min</span><p>The best pizza in town. Order by phone, drive in, pick up.</p></li>
			<li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Cakeryscakes/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">King's Cakery</a><span class="entry-meta">3 min</span><p>Classic Swedish lunch and delicious Americana-inspired pastries and cakes.</p></li>
		</ul>
		<p><strong>Gräsmark &amp; Stöpafors (15–30 min drive)</strong></p>
		<ul class="entry-list">
			<li><a href="https://www.kalasmakeriet.se/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kalasmakeriet</a><span class="entry-meta">30 min · Gräsmark</span><p>Delicious lunch and dinner buffets — and cakes from heaven. A good stop after a hike.</p></li>
			<li><a href="https://diner45.se/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Diner45</a><span class="entry-meta">20 min · Stöpafors</span><p>A classic American diner that found its way to Värmland — shakes, burgers, fries. A good way to round off a hike around Tossebergsklätten; check out the flea market in Stöpafors while you're there.</p></li>
			<li><a href="https://sv-se.facebook.com/pages/category/Travel-Company/Rokkmakkstugan-%C3%84ngen-615575338514403/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Rockmackstugan</a><span class="entry-meta">30 min · Ängen</span><p>Waffles and soup — a nice treat after hiking or cross-country skiing.</p></li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Bars &amp; Breweries</h2>
		<ul class="entry-list">
			<li><a href="https://sv-se.facebook.com/Restaurangslottet" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Restaurang Slottet</a><p>Get a beer with the locals.</p></li>
			<li><a href="https://selmaspa.se/restaurang-och-barer-just-nu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Selma Spa Hotel</a><p>A fancy drink with a view.</p></li>
			<li><a href="http://www.vastraamterviksbryggeri.se/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Västra Ämterviks Bryggeri</a><p>Sunne's local brewery — tastings upon request.</p></li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Groceries</h2>
		<p>Arrive like a pro and stock the farmhouse with pre-ordered groceries. Sunne has two grocery stores — only ICA BBB delivers to the farmhouse (Öjervik 115, 686 94 Rottneros).</p>
		<ul class="entry-list">
			<li>
				<span class="entry-title">ICA BBB</span><br />
				Storgatan 32, 686 30 Sunne — open daily 8 AM–10 PM<br />
				<a href="https://www.ica.se/butiker/supermarket/sunne/ica-supermarket-bbb-sunne-857/start/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Order online →</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="entry-title">Coop</span><br />
				Bryggargatan 7, 686 30 Sunne — open daily 8 AM–9 PM<br />
				<a href="https://www.coop.se/butiker-erbjudanden/coop/sunne/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website →</a>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</Layout>
